  "text": "Specimen Dental — July 2026 performance\nVisits are measured as page views, not unique visitors.\n\nPage views: 1,240 · 24% above last month\nCalls: 48 · 20% above last month\nDirections: 31 · No change from last month\nInquiry actions: 21 · 163% above last month\nChat clicks 12 · Form submissions 9 · Booking clicks 17 · Instagram clicks 5\n\nInsight: Google traffic increased 33% from last month.\nTraffic sources: Google 800 (65%), Direct or on-site 300 (24%), Instagram 100 (8%), Other 40 (3%)\n\nView details: https://anakslabs.com/dashboard/reports\n\nThis report uses anonymous aggregate measurements and does not guarantee search rankings or business results."
